OL,3,GNEWSARaye wins Mercury Prize 2026 with
OL,4,Aalbum This Music May Contain Hope
OL,5,
OL,6,FRaye wins the Mercury Prize for her
OL,7,Falbum This Music May Contain Hope
OL,9,FSpeaking to the BBC after her win, she
OL,10,Fsays she "poured everything I had into
OL,11,Fthis body of work"
OL,13,FThe Where Is My Husband! singer beat 11
OL,14,Fother nominees including Jade, Dave and
OL,15,FOlivia Dean to take home the trophy and
OL,16,F#25,000
OL,18,FEach year, the Mercury Prize rewards
OL,19,Fthe best music from the UK and Ireland,
OL,20,Fhighlighting 12 Albums of the Year
OL,21,Facross a wide spectrum of genres
